# OpenAI — powers file explanations, compare summaries, and the default
# Repo Guidance model (see the model registry in lib/llm/models.ts:
# gpt-6-luna, reasoning effort medium).
# OPTIONAL: without a key the city works fully; explanations and change
# summaries show a readable disabled message instead.
OPENAI_API_KEY=""

# Anthropic — the second Repo Guidance model, claude-haiku-5-5, selectable
# in the Repo Guidance flow (file explanations stay on the OpenAI model).
# OPTIONAL: only needed when you pick Claude Haiku 5.5 there; without a key
# that choice fails with a readable 503 and the OpenAI model keeps working.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=""
